            "q": "How is experiential project-based learning at Heritage Xperiential School different from conventional CBSE schools?",
            "a": "Unlike traditional rote learning systems, Heritage Xperiential Learning School (HXLS) follows a multidisciplinary expeditionary learning pedagogy aligned with CBSE and NEP 2020. Students learn core subjects through real-world problem solving, field research, and collaborative maker projects rather than textbook memorization alone.",
