            "a": "As per the official fee schedule (https://www.heritagexperiential.org/sec62-fee-structure/), one-time non-refundable Admission Fee is ₹2,30,000 and Caution Money (refundable) is ₹1,13,900 to ₹1,33,000. Recurring Composite Tuition Fee is billed quarterly ranging from ₹1,13,900 per quarter for Nursery to Class 3 (approx ₹4,55,600 annually) up to ₹1,3",
